&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Python for backend services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;TypeScript and React for web applications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Azure and infrastructure as code&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
