&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re someone who likes to imagine new possibilities and build better systems rather than plug-in to outdated ones, Quince is the place for you.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE ROLE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Director of Specialty Fibers&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role ensures that every product made from cashmere, merino, yak, alpaca, and other luxury fibers meets Quince&#39;s uncompromising standards for quality, sustainability, and affordability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Director blends deep technical expertise in fiber science with strategic supply chain leadership and cross-functional collaboration, serving as the central hub connecting sourcing, production, quality, and design teams across global markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Strategic Leadership &amp;amp; Supply Chain Management&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Orchestrate the end-to-end supply chain as the central hub connecting sourcing managers, production teams, and quality specialists to ensure a seamless, resilient, and efficient flow from fiber to finished yarn.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and mentor a diverse, specialized team of sourcing managers, quality engineers, and production experts, fostering a culture of continuous improvement and technical excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive multi-sourcing and nearshoring strategies to mitigate geopolitical and logistical risks while ensuring a stable supply of high-grade fibers from the Americas and Asia.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set the strategic direction for vertical integration opportunities, evaluating build-vs-buy decisions for spinning, dyeing, or finishing capabilities that could enhance quality control and margin structure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a key advisor to the executive team on fiber market trends, geopolitical risks (e.g., trade tariffs, export restrictions), climate impacts on raw material supply, and competitive intelligence—translating complex data into actionable business recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion Quince&#39;s &quot;unreal prices&quot; mission by continuously identifying cost-leadership opportunities across the supply chain, from farm to finished yarn, without compromising ethical standards or product integrity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Sourcing &amp;amp; Supplier Development&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and curate a best-in-class supplier ecosystem, identifying, vetting, and onboarding mills, dehairers, spinners, and dye houses that meet Quince&#39;s exacting standards for quality, capacity, sustainability, and labor practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead supplier development programs, coaching strategic partners to improve yield, reduce defects, adopt sustainable practices, and achieve cost efficiencies that benefit both parties.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive traceability and transparency across the entire fiber supply chain, from herder cooperatives and farms to finished yarn. Partner with certification bodies (GOTS, RWS, GCS, ZQ) to ensure chain-of-custody integrity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make high-stakes sourcing decisions based on deep market intelligence—including auction prices, crop forecasts, currency fluctuations, and geopolitical developments—balancing short-term cost opportunities with long-term relationship value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Quality Assurance &amp;amp; Technical Optimization&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Architect the quality management system for all specialty fibers, defining standards, testing protocols, and approval workflows for raw fiber, dehaired fiber, tops, yarns, and finished goods.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the Senior Manager, Natural Fibers Quality to establish measurable quality benchmarks, including micron distribution, fiber length, tensile strength, yield, color fastness, and pilling resistance—ensuring every lot meets or exceeds luxury brand parity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee third-party lab testing and compliance, working with the Cashmere Spec/Test Report/Compliance Auditor to validate that all materials meet international standards (ISO, OEKO-TEX, GOTS, REACH) and Quince&#39;s internal specifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead root-cause analysis for quality failures, implementing corrective and preventive actions (CAPA) across the supply chain. Drive a culture of &quot;quality at the source,&quot; empowering suppliers to self-detect and correct issues before production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with product development and design teams to translate aesthetic and tactile visions into technical specifications—micron targets, twist levels, finishing treatments—that are manufacturable at scale and cost.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the central point of communication for all fiber-related matters, providing technical expertise and clear direction to design, product development, and production teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate daily with domestic and overseas mills, dye houses, and suppliers to give precise, actionable feedback on fiber quality, color accuracy, availability and production timelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate design and merchandising visions into clear, manufacturable technical briefs for suppliers, ensuring that product aesthetics and performance meet Quince&#39;s brand standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead blind panels with design, merchandising, and customer focus groups to validate luxury fiber perception and color accuracy before commercialization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Required&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Degree in Textile Science, Fiber Engineering, Material Science, Supply Chain Management, Color Chemistry, or related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;15+ years of experience in specialty fiber sourcing, yarn production, quality management, or coloration for apparel, accessories, or home textiles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep technical knowledge of natural fibers (cashmere, merino, yak, alpaca, cotton), spinning processes (woolen, worsted)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven leadership experience managing cross-functional teams in a fast-paced retail or manufacturing environment, with a track record of mentoring and developing talent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong cost analysis skills: cost-per-kilogram modeling, yield optimization, landed cost analysis, and budget management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building and maintaining quality standards, and supplier compliance programs, including SKU rationalization and shade consolidation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills with the ability to translate complex technical concepts for non-technical stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Preferred&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with sustainable fibers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of supply chain traceability including blockchain or digital tracking systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with PLM systems and quality database management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in luxury goods (apparel, home and accessories) with an eye for premium aesthetics, handfeel, and trend forecasting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3319&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;WHY QUINCE?&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3352&quot;&gt;Joining Quince means being part of a mission-driven team reshaping retail. You will work alongside talented colleagues, tackle meaningful challenges, and contribute to building a more sustainable, accessible future for customers and partners alike.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3604&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;EQUAL OPPORTUNITY &amp;amp; HIRING INTEGRITY&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3662&quot;&gt;Quince provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applications for employment and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran or military status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state, or local laws.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4074&quot;&gt;Quince is committed to providing reasonable accommodations to qualified individuals with disabilities. If you need a reasonable accommodation to complete your application or to perform the essential functions of a role at Quince, please let us know by completing &lt;a href=&quot;https://forms.gle/DpJ11jHa1WbqfUWB9&quot;&gt;this accommodation form&lt;/a&gt;. We review all requests individually and will work with you to determine appropriate accommodations on a case-by-case basis.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4428&quot;&gt;Employment is contingent upon successful completion of a background check. Quince will conduct background checks in compliance with applicable federal, state, and local laws.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4604&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Security Advisory: Beware of Frauds&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4641&quot;&gt;At Quince, we&#39;re dedicated to recruiting top talent who share our drive for innovation. To safeguard candidates, Quince emphasizes legitimate recruitment practices. Initial communication is primarily via official Quince email addresses and LinkedIn; beware of deviations. Personal data and sensitive information will not be solicited during the application phase. Interviews are conducted via phone, in person, or through the approved platforms Google Meets or Zoom—never via messaging apps or other calling services. Offers are merit-based, communicated verbally, and followed up in writing. If personal information is requested to initiate the hiring process, rest assured it will be through secure and protected means.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5364&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engineering Manager, Rapid Response Assignment - UK&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Location: Remote (Cheltenham, UK)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Team: Product &amp;amp; Engineering&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Employment Type: Full-Time&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About VulnCheck&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Exploitation prevention is only as strong as the intelligence driving those efforts, and most of the industry is still running on intelligence that lacks exploit context. VulnCheck, The Exploit Intelligence Company, delivers structured exploit intelligence on what is actively weaponized in the wild, purpose-built for the data lakes, ETL pipelines, automation, and AI and LLM workflows your infrastructure already runs on, raising the capability of everything it powers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for an Engineering Manager to lead our Rapid Response organization - regionally-based teams in the US, UK, and APAC that keep our customers unblocked around the clock. You’ll manage engineering teams of senior ICs directly, set the technical and operational bar for the group, and make sure work is prioritised correctly across a demanding mix of urgent and long-term needs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This team sits at the intersection of Engineering, Customer Success, and Sales. Your teams handle urgent pre-sales requests, urgent customer issues, and other customer-driven feature requests, alongside the backend maintenance and integration work that keeps the platform stable. You’ll need to be equally comfortable setting engineering standards, coaching engineers, and triaging competing priorities across time zones. &lt;strong&gt;This is a 100% remote role, with preference for candidates located in Cheltenham, UK&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and grow engineering teams based in the US, UK, and APAC, providing hands-on people leadership, coaching, and career development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set priorities across urgent pre-sales requests, urgent customer issues, customer feature requests, and backend maintenance/integration work, balancing reactive and proactive work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure continuous, follow-the-sun coverage for urgent customer and pre-sales needs across time zones&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Customer Success and Sales leadership to understand customer and deal-critical needs and translate them into engineering plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product and other Engineering teams to ensure customer-driven work is integrated into the broader platform roadmap&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the team&#39;s engineering quality bar, including code quality, root-cause practices, and long-term fixes over one-off patches&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive hiring, onboarding, and performance management across all three regional teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish and refine on-call, escalation, and incident response processes for the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Report on team health, throughput, and customer outcomes to engineering and company leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remove blockers for your teams and stay close enough to the technical work to make credible calls under pressure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience managing software engineers, ideally across distributed or multi-region teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in cybersecurity, vulnerability management, or threat intelligence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience as a senior or staff software engineer, with credibility to engage in technical discussions and unblock your team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing customer-facing, support, sustaining, or reliability engineering teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to prioritize and sequence competing demands—urgent customer issues, pre-sales asks, and longer-term maintenance work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing teams across multiple time zones and regions, with strong async communication habits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of backend systems, APIs, distributed systems, and cloud infrastructure (AWS preferred)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A customer-obsessed mindset and a track record of turning technical challenges into strong customer outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills, with the ability to work effectively with customers, Sales, Customer Success, and other Engineering teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with data pipelines, ETL systems, or high-volume data processing is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience managing a customer reliability, sustaining, support, or escalation engineering function&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with CVE, NVD, KEV, or exploit intelligence datasets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting pre-sales or deal-critical technical requests&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in high-growth or startup environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe people do their best work when they feel supported, trusted, and valued. VulnCheck offers benefits designed to meet a wide range of needs and lifestyles, tailored to your country of employment:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous, flexible time off&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Retirement/pension plan contributions (e.g., 401k with match in the US; local pension schemes elsewhere)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comprehensive healthcare coverage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous paid parental leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remote-friendly environment with flexibility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support for home office costs (phone &amp;amp; internet)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ongoing professional development, coaching, and learning resources&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunities for career advancement within a fast-growing team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Specific benefit details vary by country and are confirmed during the offer process.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Built on over two decades of cybersecurity experience, our team of experts understands the intricacies of vulnerabilities, their exploitation in the wild, and how to leverage this data to build more effective cybersecurity products that produce better outcomes for organizations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VulnCheck gives organizations a tactical advantage by providing best-in-class exploit &amp;amp; vulnerability intelligence information. We have a sense of duty to protect the critical infrastructure we rely on including medical devices, power grids and telecommunication networks. We were founded in 2021 in Lexington, Massachusetts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VulnCheck has a transparent, collaborative, and supportive culture - we are looking for people who have a growth mindset, are curious and innovative. Our team is smart, but humble, hardworking, and supportive.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VulnCheck is proud to be an Equal Employer Opportunity employer. We do not discriminate based upon race, religion, color, national origin, gender (including pregnancy, childbirth, or related medical conditions), sexual orientation, gender identity, gender expression, age, status as a protected veteran, status as an individual with a disability, or other applicable legally protected characteristics. VulnCheck is committed to working with and providing reasonable accommodations to applicants with physical and mental disabilities. *Even if your experience doesn’t perfectly align with the job description, we encourage you to apply—we value potential just as much as a perfect resume.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h1 class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-section-id=&quot;1etcwvt&quot; data-start=&quot;457&quot; data-end=&quot;510&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Senior Software Development Engineer in Test (SDET)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;512&quot; data-end=&quot;609&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;512&quot; data-end=&quot;525&quot;&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; London (Hybrid) | &lt;strong data-start=&quot;544&quot; data-end=&quot;562&quot;&gt;Practice Area:&lt;/strong&gt; Technology &amp;amp; Engineering | &lt;strong data-start=&quot;590&quot; data-end=&quot;599&quot;&gt;Type:&lt;/strong&gt; Permanent&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;611&quot; data-end=&quot;688&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;611&quot; data-end=&quot;688&quot;&gt;Advance your testing career while shaping digital finance with automation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;1hl1yo8&quot; data-start=&quot;690&quot; data-end=&quot;705&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;693&quot; data-end=&quot;705&quot;&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;707&quot; data-end=&quot;999&quot;&gt;Capco is growing our Engineering team and we&#39;re looking for experienced SDETs with a passion for delivering innovative solutions in financial services. If you enjoy solving complex problems, working with cloud-native technologies, and collaborating in agile teams, we&#39;d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1001&quot; data-end=&quot;1674&quot;&gt;As a Senior Software Development Engineer in Test (SDET) at Capco, you&#39;ll contribute to high-impact, client-facing projects that shape the future of financial services. You&#39;ll work alongside talented engineers, gain access to industry-leading training, and have opportunities to develop your expertise across multiple technology platforms and business domains within Financial Services &amp;amp; Energy. You&#39;ll also embrace AI-enabled ways of working, using approved AI and automation tools where appropriate to improve engineering productivity, accelerate test delivery, and enhance software quality while applying sound engineering judgement and responsible AI practices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;1xihhvk&quot; data-start=&quot;1676&quot; data-end=&quot;1697&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1679&quot; data-end=&quot;1697&quot;&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1699&quot; data-end=&quot;2519&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;133qpt0&quot; data-start=&quot;1699&quot; data-end=&quot;1901&quot;&gt;Design and implement robust, reusable, and scalable test strategies and automation frameworks, applying AI-enabled engineering approaches where appropriate to improve efficiency and test coverage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1k7tzn6&quot; data-start=&quot;1902&quot; data-end=&quot;2051&quot;&gt;Develop and maintain test artefacts, including test plans, specifications, automated scripts, and quality reporting to support end-to-end delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1h191g2&quot; data-start=&quot;2052&quot; data-end=&quot;2182&quot;&gt;Manage test environments and generate reliable, consistent test data to support functional, integration, and regression testing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1bknspb&quot; data-start=&quot;2183&quot; data-end=&quot;2304&quot;&gt;Execute &lt;em class=&quot;Highlight ht233d6209-1330-41b6-a261-eee046307807&quot;&gt;UI&lt;/em&gt; and &lt;em class=&quot;Highlight ht233d6209-1330-41b6-a261-eee046307807&quot;&gt;API&lt;/em&gt; automation using modern testing frameworks while integrating automated testing into CI/CD pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1g57c0v&quot; data-start=&quot;2305&quot; data-end=&quot;2519&quot;&gt;Collaborate with engineers and cross-functional teams to deliver quality-first solutions, encouraging the responsible use of approved AI tools and automation to improve collaboration and engineering outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;u9wmb5&quot; data-start=&quot;2521&quot; data-end=&quot;2550&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2524&quot; data-end=&quot;2550&quot;&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2552&quot; data-end=&quot;3212&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1pxt3dg&quot; data-start=&quot;2552&quot; data-end=&quot;2660&quot;&gt;Strong knowledge of at least one object-oriented programming language, such as &lt;em class=&quot;Highlight ht12570a5c-fe4a-4faf-85ad-9359aedf0c1d&quot;&gt;Java&lt;/em&gt;, &lt;em class=&quot;Highlight ht12570a5c-fe4a-4faf-85ad-9359aedf0c1d&quot;&gt;Scala&lt;/em&gt;, or &lt;em class=&quot;Highlight hte8d84c36-3d11-4b5d-af91-f34d644d37f4&quot;&gt;JavaScript&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;kwxspc&quot; data-start=&quot;2661&quot; data-end=&quot;2802&quot;&gt;Experience designing and building test automation frameworks using tools such as &lt;em class=&quot;Highlight ht233d6209-1330-41b6-a261-eee046307807&quot;&gt;Selenium&lt;/em&gt;, &lt;em class=&quot;Highlight ht233d6209-1330-41b6-a261-eee046307807&quot;&gt;Cypress&lt;/em&gt;, Playwright, or equivalent technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;byn3hj&quot; data-start=&quot;2803&quot; data-end=&quot;2918&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience with &lt;em class=&quot;Highlight ht233d6209-1330-41b6-a261-eee046307807&quot;&gt;UI&lt;/em&gt; and &lt;em class=&quot;Highlight ht233d6209-1330-41b6-a261-eee046307807&quot;&gt;API&lt;/em&gt; automation, alongside a solid understanding of quality engineering practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;x31mnm&quot; data-start=&quot;2919&quot; data-end=&quot;3024&quot;&gt;Familiarity with Jira, TestRail, Jenkins, GitHub, SonarQube, CI/CD pipelines, and cloud infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1ioaxep&quot; data-start=&quot;3025&quot; data-end=&quot;3212&quot;&gt;Experience using AI-enabled tools responsibly to improve engineering productivity while maintaining appropriate human oversight, governance, software quality, and testing standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
